OL,3,GNEWSAThe woman capturing the beauty of
OL,4,Athe skies on camera
OL,5,
OL,6,FA BBC Weather Watcher who regularly
OL,7,Fshares her photographs with the
OL,8,Forganisation has been shortlisted for a
OL,9,Fprestigious international photography
OL,10,Faward.
OL,12,FRachel Cassidy is the only photographer
OL,13,Ffrom Northern Ireland to reach the
OL,14,Ffinal shortlist of the Royal
OL,15,FMeteorological Society's Weather
OL,16,F(RMetS) Photographer of the Year 2026
OL,17,Fcompetition.
OL,19,FHer photograph, A Midsummer Night's
OL,20,FDream, captures a display of
OL,21,Fnoctilucent clouds above Binevenagh and
OL,22,FLough Foyle on the north coast.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
